#!/bin/bash
# List the games installed on this machine.
cat <<'EOF'

  ======================  THE ARCADE  ======================

  pacman4console   Pac-Man, made of letters           (q quits)
  nsnake           Snake. Don't bite yourself.
  ninvaders        Space Invaders
  bastet           Tetris, but it hates you. Bastard Tetris.
  moon-buggy       Drive on the moon. Jump the craters.
  greed            Eat numbers. Don't get trapped.
  robots           Escape the robots by making them crash
  worm             The original snake, from 1980-something
  hangman          You know this one
  adventure        Colossal Cave (1976), the first text adventure
                   ever. Try typing:  go in   (or xyzzy)
  wump             Hunt the Wumpus (1973). Bring arrows.
  tetris-bsd       Regular Tetris, for the faint of heart

  Most quit with q or Ctrl+C. Older games: try Ctrl+C.

  ==========  most of these games are older than you  ==========

EOF
